              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">GAS IS VALUED AT THE PINE NEEDLE SPOT PRICE WHICH IS THE &#8220;SOUTHEAST DELIVERED TO PIPELINE&#8221; PRICE AS PUBLISHED IN THE NATURAL GAS WEEK.</span>
